        },
        {
          "text": " Abu ŋesi kotema totoke atiar, “Atutubeta akwat atomon ka nadiopet nuka epuesa nuaponi koyanaarai kaneiiai ijo, nuibu ijo kilam, ibu da kiner kapupi, koany, ejai epuesa neaiai eoŋ; eoŋ abu kayaŋa ŋes.” Kotema totoke atiar, “Kisireren EJAKAIT okokuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
