        },
        {
          "text": " Ajai ekatumunan loka Bct-lekem-yuda, loka ateker naka Yuda, Ioarai Elebit, eboienenei kanen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyou etuŋanan kore, koBet-lekem-yuda, aiboiororoi kaneedumunia aibois: kodol akwap nakiukon naka Epuraim, togo loka Mika, kalositeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Mika ŋes atiar, “Ai bo kibunio? “Kotema ŋes atiar, “Arai eoŋ Elebit loka Bct-lekem-yuda, alosi aiboiororoi neadumunia aibois.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
